## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00 — Thứ Hai: Daily Standup

### 16:30–16:40 · Shadowing

### 16:40–16:55 · Standup có ghi âm

> *"Morning. Last week I finished the New Architecture work — a TurboModule written both the hard way and with the Expo Modules API.*
> *This week is performance. Today was purely measurement — I'm not changing any code until I have numbers. I set up Flashlight for automated scoring, ran it against a Maestro flow so the scenario is repeatable, and used the React DevTools Profiler to find where re-renders are happening.*
> *I found two things worth fixing: the meal form re-renders entirely on every keystroke, and list items re-render on scroll even when their data hasn't changed.*
> *Tomorrow I'll fix those and re-measure.*
> *One thing I'm being careful about is separating UI thread problems from JavaScript thread problems. Memoisation only helps with the second kind, and it's easy to waste a day optimising the wrong layer."*

### 16:55–17:00 · 5 từ mới

| Từ / cụm | Nghĩa | Câu mẫu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `baseline` (n) | số đo nền, mốc so sánh | *I captured a baseline first.* |
| `repeatable` (adj) | lặp lại được | *The scenario is repeatable.* |
| `re-render` (n/v) | render lại | *Where re-renders are happening.* |
| `keystroke` (n) | mỗi lần gõ phím | *It re-renders on every keystroke.* |
| `waste a day on` | phí một ngày vào | *Easy to waste a day optimising the wrong layer.* |

